        <div class="weight-sample-title" style="font-weight: 500;">
          <span class="baseline-demo">IAMHA Matthieu Huguet</span> : The Legend of Zelda (1997)
        </div>
        <div class="weight-sample-sub" style="font-weight: 500;">時の勇者リンク / 0123456789 / abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz (e, a, t, g, m, u, o, s)</div>
